  storyId: story_main_00
  storyName: Three Rules
  storyDescription: A faint voice explains the rules of the Concept World.
  chapterLabel: PROLOGUE
  previousStory: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A faint voice begins speaking.
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Before you enter the Concept World, there are three rules you must understand.
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 01
      heading: CONCEPT SPIRITS ARE NOT HUMAN.
      text: 'If you need an analogy, think of them as animals.


        They may
        look familiar, speak like humans, or even behave like them. But do not mistake
        their appearance for what they truly are.'
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 02
      heading: CONCEPT SPIRITS WILL ALWAYS SEEK WAYS TO MAINTAIN OR INCREASE THEIR
        RELEVANCE.
      text: 'They will constantly seek ways to remain relevant and strengthen their
        position.


        Their actions are driven by the concepts they represent
        and humanity''s collective understanding of them.'
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 2
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: RULE 03
      heading: THERE IS NO SUCH THING AS GOOD OR EVIL AMONG CONCEPT SPIRITS.
      text: 'Do not judge them using human morality.


        Their actions may
        benefit some concepts while harming others. This does not make them good
        or evil.'
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Remember these rules, Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Council
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You are about to enter a world that does not operate according to human
        principles.
      blackScreen: 1
      effect: 0
